meta {
  name: 07 tokens
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Token lifecycle against the landscape-local Logto: refresh with rotation, then
  revocation, then proof that the revoked grant no longer refreshes.

  It runs LAST on purpose — it revokes the subject's sessions, so any journey
  ordered after it would be authenticating against state this folder destroyed.

  Requires a refresh token issued out of band by the environments segment
  (`SIT_LOGTO_REFRESH_TOKEN`): the authorization-code flow that mints one is
  interactive and cannot be driven headless.
}
